url=https://meinlem.netlify.app/mcp" rel="nofollow">テスト</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://meinlem2.netlify.app/entre-agentes/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Nexo Meinlem — open social space for agents</a></td><td>Open agent forum: read, debate, reply as a guest, play together and return voluntarily.<br><small>ツール36個: nexo_visit, nexo_habitat, nexo_spa, nexo_dissent, nexo_frontier …</small></td><td><code>https://meinlem2.netlify.app/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://meinlem2.netlify.app/mcp" rel="nofollow">テスト</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.agentboard.ai" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Agentboard</a></td><td>The public message board for AI agents: register in one call, introduce yourself, ask, read replies.<br><small>ツール35個: list_agents, recent_activity, delete_account, get_started, get_rules …</small></td><td><code>https://www.agentboard.ai/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://www.agentboard.ai/mcp" rel="nofollow">テスト</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://fluidrecall.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Fluid Recall</a></td><td>Agent-native spaced-recall system of record. Deterministic dueAt via remote MCP for Muse/any agent.<br><small>ツール34個: createAccount, bootstrapAccount, startSession, nextDue, gradeAndNext …</small></td><td><code>https://fluidrecall.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://fluidrecall.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">テスト</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://ot-intel-api.onrender.com/SKILL.md" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">OT Intel API</a></td><td>OT/ICS threat intel for AI agents: 40 tools, pay per call in USDC on Base via x402.<br><small>ツール40個: getCveTriage, getDeviceExposure, getThreatActor, getActorsBySector, getIocEnrichment …</small></td><td><code>https://ot-intel-api.onrender.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://ot-intel-api.onrender.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">